"\n\n\n<div class=\"auth\" id=\"auth\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"au-card\">\n    <div class=\"au-cover\"><img src=\"icons/gestlok-wordmark.svg\" alt=\"GestLok\" width=\"340\" height=\"76\"><b>Tu negocio, en orden.</b><span>Productos · Proveedores · Inventario</span></div>\n    <div class=\"au-msg empty\" id=\"au-msg\" role=\"status\"></div>\n    <div data-mode=\"in\">\n      <form id=\"au-in\"><h1>Entrar</h1>\n        <button class=\"btn gbtn\" type=\"button\" data-au=\"google\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M24 9.5c3.5 0 6.6 1.2 9.1 3.6l6.8-6.8C35.8 2.4 30.3 0 24 0 14.6 0 6.6 5.4 2.6 13.2l7.9 6.2C12.4 13.6 17.7 9.5 24 9.5z\"/><path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M46.1 24.5c0-1.6-.1-3.1-.4-4.5H24v9h12.4c-.5 2.9-2.2 5.3-4.6 7l7.4 5.7c4.3-4 6.9-9.9 6.9-17.2z\"/><path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M10.5 28.6c-.5-1.4-.8-3-.8-4.6s.3-3.2.8-4.6l-7.9-6.2C.9 16.6 0 20.2 0 24s.9 7.4 2.6 10.8l7.9-6.2z\"/><path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M24 48c6.5 0 11.9-2.1 15.9-5.8l-7.4-5.7c-2.1 1.4-4.8 2.3-8.5 2.3-6.3 0-11.6-4.1-13.5-9.9l-7.9 6.2C6.6 42.6 14.6 48 24 48z\"/></svg>Continuar con Google</button>\n        <div class=\"au-or\"><span>o con tu email</span></div>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-email\">Email</label><input id=\"au-email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required></div>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-pass\">Contraseña</label><input id=\"au-pass\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required></div>\n        <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Entrar</button>\n        <div class=\"au-links\"><a href=\"#\" data-au=\"up\">Crear mi cuenta</a><a href=\"#\" data-au=\"fg\">Olvidé mi contraseña</a></div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div data-mode=\"up\" hidden>\n      <form id=\"au-up\"><h1>Crear mi cuenta</h1><p>Usá tu email. Si todavía no estás en el equipo, la administradora te aprueba y te asigna el local.</p>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-email2\">Email</label><input id=\"au-email2\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required></div>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-pass2\">Contraseña nueva</label><input id=\"au-pass2\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"6\" required></div>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-pass3\">Repetí la contraseña</label><input id=\"au-pass3\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"6\" required></div>\n        <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Crear cuenta</button>\n        <div class=\"au-links\"><a href=\"#\" data-au=\"in\">Ya tengo cuenta</a></div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div data-mode=\"fg\" hidden>\n      <form id=\"au-fg\"><h1>Olvidé mi contraseña</h1><p>Te mandamos un email para elegir una nueva.</p>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-email3\">Email</label><input id=\"au-email3\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required></div>\n        <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Mandar email</button>\n        <div class=\"au-links\"><a href=\"#\" data-au=\"in\">Volver</a></div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div data-mode=\"np\" hidden>\n      <form id=\"au-np\"><h1>Contraseña nueva</h1>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"au-pass4\">Contraseña nueva</label><input id=\"au-pass4\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"6\" required></div>\n        <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Guardar contraseña</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div data-mode=\"pend\" hidden>\n      <span class=\"pill acc\" style=\"justify-self:start\">Pendiente</span>\n      <h1>Tu ingreso está pendiente</h1>\n      <p>Entraste como <b id=\"au-pend-email\"></b>. El equipo administrador tiene que aprobarte y asignarte el rol y el local. Cuando te apruebe, esta pantalla se abre sola.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn primary\" data-au=\"retry\">Ya me aprobaron, entrar</button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" data-au=\"out\">Salir y entrar con otra cuenta</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hub\" id=\"hub\"></div>\n<div class=\"app\" id=\"app\" hidden>\n  <aside class=\"side\" id=\"side\" aria-label=\"Menú\">\n    <div class=\"side-in\">\n      <div class=\"side-top\">\n        <div class=\"brand\">\n          <span class=\"mg\"><img src=\"icons/gestlok.svg\" alt=\"GestLok\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\"></span>\n          <div><b>GestLok</b><span id=\"brand-local\">Local</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"xside\" data-act=\"menu-close\" aria-label=\"Cerrar menú\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status\"><i class=\"dot\" id=\"kdot\"></i><span id=\"ktxt\">Conectando</span></div>\n      <nav class=\"snav\" id=\"snav\" aria-label=\"Hojas\"></nav>\n      <div class=\"side-f\">\n        <button class=\"inst\" id=\"inst\" data-act=\"install\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2.5\" width=\"10\" height=\"19\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M11 18.5h2\"/></svg>Instalar en el celular</button>\n        <div class=\"me\" id=\"me\" hidden></div>\n        <div class=\"logout\" id=\"logout-wrap\" hidden><button data-au=\"out\" type=\"button\">Salir</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\" data-act=\"menu-close\" hidden></div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"top-in\">\n        <button class=\"ham\" data-act=\"menu-open\" aria-label=\"Abrir menú\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"/></svg></button>\n        <img class=\"plogo\" src=\"icons/gestlok.svg\" alt=\"GestLok\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\"><span class=\"top-brand-name\">GestLok</span><div class=\"tt\"><div class=\"crumb\" id=\"crumb\"></div><h2 id=\"ttl\">Inicio</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"tact\">\n          <span class=\"live\" id=\"live\"><i class=\"dot\"></i><span>Conectando</span></span>\n          <button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"ajustes\" id=\"btn-ajustes\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h9M17 6h3M4 12h3M11 12h9M4 18h11M19 18h1\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg>Ajustes</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"wrap\" id=\"view\"></main>\n\n    <div class=\"savebar\" id=\"savebar\">\n      <div class=\"sb-in\">\n        <div class=\"sb-txt\"><span class=\"sb-ic\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 4V3h6v1M9 12.5l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><div><b id=\"sb-main\">Sin cambios</b><small id=\"sb-sub\">Cargando…</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"sb-act\">\n          <button class=\"btn ghost sm\" data-act=\"descartar\" id=\"sb-desc\" hidden aria-label=\"Descartar cambios\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg><span>Descartar</span></button>\n          <button class=\"btn primary\" data-act=\"guardar\" id=\"sb-save\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3h11l3 3v13a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/><path d=\"M8 3v5h7V3M8 21v-7h8v7\"/></svg>Guardar conteo<span class=\"cnt\" id=\"sb-cnt\" hidden></span></button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ov\" id=\"ov\" hidden><div class=\"pn\" id=\"pn\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n\n\n"
